      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I finally decided to try Apollo Energy Solutions from the three solar battery suppliers recommended by Finn Peacock and very quickly Lewis arranged to visit to assess my needs and assist with what I wanted.  He was informed, helpful and not pushy, so very good experience.  The total price was under what I had estimated. Apollo Energy Solutions is based at Beresfield, just north of Newcastle, so fairly local to me.They can see my system operating and will take steps to resolve any issues. The fact they are only 17 kms away is excellent.I signed up and was given a date for the install. A team of three arrived on time on the given date.They said it would take about 6 hours. It took just under and the site was left immaculately. They were well presented, answered all questions, were polite, kept me informed as to what was happening.  Asked permission to enter the house each time and were in no way intrusive.The supervisor set up my digital monitoring system and ran me through it. He showed me the system operating and ran through safety checks carefully and repeated them. They made a slight alteration, at my request, in the case of blackouts which means I will have hot water if a blackout occurs - brilliant!I am very pleased with the whole process from initial contact to switching on. I watched my digital display this morning and my battery is now 100% charged and exporting to the grid.",
